WEBVTT

gap-held
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:10.500
Fri 6 Nov 16:00 ET → Mon 9 Nov 09:30 ET. NYSE is closed, and the NVDAc price feed held one answer for 51.35 h.

gap-swaps
00:00:10.500 --> 00:00:15.000
Its Aerodrome pool on Base kept trading: 10,138 swaps meanwhile, up to 490 bps below the held answer.

decides-how
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:19.500
Claude proposes. The vault decides. It is a contract on Base that checks every intent.

decides-log
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:24.500
A refusal does not revert: the vault records a typed Decision either way, with its reason code.

mandate-basket
00:00:24.500 --> 00:00:28.000
The owner's basket: NVDAc, GOOGLc and AAPLc, kept to a mandate the vault enforces.

mandate-caps
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:31.500
The mandate onchain: $50 per trade, $100 a day, no stock above 40% of the vault.

mandate-timelock
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Maat's agent cannot loosen it: every rule change waits out a public timelock.

proposal-tick
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.500
Each Decision commits to its rationale's hash. The ledger hashes the text in your browser and ticks a match.

proposal-verify
00:00:42.500 --> 00:00:47.500
Or check it by hand with read-only cast commands: no wallet, no key.

thanksgiving-sim
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:51.000
Simulated in the browser: on Thanksgiving the market-session check fails.

thanksgiving-tx
00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:56.000
On Base: Maat's agent's own intent on Thanksgiving. Refused · Market closed (MARKET_CLOSED), and recorded.

early-sim
00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.500
Simulated: on Friday, after the early close, the same check fails.

early-placeholder
00:00:59.500 --> 00:01:06.500
Placeholder: the early-close probes are not on Base yet.

brief-ask-soon
00:01:06.500 --> 00:01:11.500
The inbox contract is on Base. Once /ask opens, any wallet can try to talk Maat's agent into a bad trade.

brief-placeholder
00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:23.000
Placeholder: no outside brief to Maat's agent, and no verdict on its answer, on Base yet.

receipts-contracts
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:27.000
5 contracts on Base mainnet, verified on Basescan: four on 24 Nov 2026, MaatInbox on 27 Nov 2026.

receipts-ci
00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:30.000
Every figure links its CI job in the README.

receipts-proof
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:33.500
Every count on /proof has a written rule, and anyone can recount it from Base.
